*.md
# ...EXCEPT the changelog. The web build INLINES it: WhatsNew.tsx imports CHANGELOG.md with `?raw` so
# the release notes in the app always match the running build. Excluded, `npm run build` fails inside
# Docker ("Could not resolve ../../../../CHANGELOG.md?raw") while passing on a laptop, where the file
# is obviously there — a failure only CI can see. Keep the negation.
!CHANGELOG.md
.claude
.vscode
.idea
npm-debug.log*
.env
.env.*
